---
/* Verbatim from the design. Fixed chrome; the controller writes [data-clock] every second
   and rewrites font-size / left / right on compact viewports. */
---
<nav style="position:absolute;top:26px;left:48px;right:48px;z-index:60;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;font-family:'SN Ja Mono',ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-weight:300;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em">
<div style="font-family:'Denim INK WD',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.02em"><a href="/">ALL OF IT NOW</a></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px">
<a href="/work" style="color:rgba(217,225,234,0.45)">WORK</a>
<span>SERVICES</span>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;text-align:right">
<span data-clock="">16:40:11 GMT-7</span>
<span style="color:rgba(217,225,234,0.72)">LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA</span>
</div>
</nav>
